# What may enter the build of the service image (Dockerfile.serving; docs/mlops.md §9).
#
# An allow-list of its own, much shorter than .dockerignore: the service needs five
# source files and the two files that pin its dependencies. Everything else is excluded,
# also the rest of src/hmrec/.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
src/*
!src/hmrec/
src/hmrec/*
!src/hmrec/__init__.py
!src/hmrec/serving_set.py
!src/hmrec/structured_logs.py
!src/hmrec/serving/

**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
